24:     "description": "<p class=\"text-node\">Superteam Vietnam is hosting \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/SuperteamVN/status/2099532805227303290?s=20\">Road to Colosseum</a>,\" a 4-week hybrid training track to get builders Colosseum-ready, and you can get paid to document it. Attend a workshop, share your key learnings on X, and drop your post link below. The top 10 creators will share the bounty pool.</p><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>How to enter</strong></h2><ol class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\">Engage with the ANN of the <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/SuperteamVN/status/2099532805227303290?s=20\">Side Track</a></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Attend a Road to Colosseum session, offline or online. Schedule and registration: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam\">https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam</a></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Post on X about it. Tag <code class=\"inline\" spellcheck=\"false\">@superteamvn</code> and <code class=\"inline\" spellcheck=\"false\">@solana</code>. Use <code class=\"inline\" spellcheck=\"false\">#RoadToColosseum</code> and <code class=\"inline\" spellcheck=\"false\">#ProofOfBuild</code>.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Post each week. Save your post links as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Submit once, at the end. Paste your best post as the submission link, then list all your post links with the date of each one (a Google Doc works, or just paste them in the \"Anything Else\" field). <br>Format: Sept 18 -<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/\">https://x.com/</a>... That list is how we score consistency.</p></li></ol><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>What a good post looks like</strong></h2><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\">One specific thing you learned. \"Great session, thanks team\" scores zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Your build progress: what you shipped after the session, what broke, what you're stuck on.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">A photo, screenshot, or code snippet. Show the work.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Threads are fine. So is a three-line post. No minimum length, and padding hurts you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>How we score</strong></h2><p class=\"text-node\">• Quality of sharing (primary): clarity, authenticity, storytelling, depth of insight</p><p class=\"text-node\">• Engagement (secondary): likes, replies, reposts, not the sole factor</p><p class=\"text-node\">• Consistency bonus: builders who share across multiple weeks rank higher</p><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"text-node\">$1,000 total, 20 winners.</p><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\">Best Content, top 5: $100 each</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Active Contributors, next 5: $50 each</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>Deadline</strong></h2><p class=\"text-node\">Sept 17 to Oct 12, 23:59 ICT. Winners announced 2 weeks later.</p><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><strong>Rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\">You must have attended at least one session. Please register here: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam\">https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam</a></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">One submission per person. You can use the google doc links and list all your links there. If you use a Google Doc, set it to \"Anyone with the link can view.\"</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">You can edit it any time before the deadline, so submit early and update as you post.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Posts you don't list in your submission won't count toward consistency, even if they used the hashtags</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Posts must be public and stay up through judging.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Write it yourself. AI-generated filler gets disqualified.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><strong>About Superteam Vietnam</strong></span></h2><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><strong>Superteam Vietnam</strong> is the local hub of the global Superteam network, supporting builders, founders, and contributors in Vietnam to learn, build, connect, and grow within the Solana ecosystem.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Through builder programs, education, community initiatives, ecosystem connections, and opportunities to go global, Superteam Vietnam helps local talent turn ideas into real products and take the next step in their builder journey.</span></p>",
