103:     "description": "<h2 class=\"heading-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>About Superteam Vietnam</strong></span></h2><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Superteam Vietnam</strong> is the local hub of the global Superteam network, supporting builders, founders, and contributors in Vietnam to learn, build, connect, and grow within the Solana ecosystem.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Through builder programs, education, community initiatives, ecosystem connections, and opportunities to go global, Superteam Vietnam helps local talent turn ideas into real products and take the next step in their builder journey.</span></p><hr><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Your Road to Colosseum Starts Here — Side Track Registration Is Open</strong></span></h2><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">We’re excited to announce <strong>Road to Colosseum</strong>, a four-week builder program hosted by <strong>Superteam Vietnam</strong> to support builders on their journey to <strong>Colosseum</strong>.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">We’ll look for a solid GTM plan, ideally with some early traction, a strong founder background and a creative idea.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Built as a local side-track program, Road to Colosseum helps builders move from idea to product, Demo Day, and a stronger Colosseum submission through hands-on workshops, mentorship, ecosystem resources, and direct feedback from experienced builders and industry leaders.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">With a <strong>$10,000 cash prize pool</strong>, infrastructure credits, and access to the wider Solana builder ecosystem, this is your chance to build something real — and take it further.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Here’s what you can expect:</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Hands-On Learning:</strong> Join practical sessions covering Colosseum, the Solana ecosystem, developer tools, infrastructure, and the fundamentals needed to start building.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Expert Mentorship:</strong> Get direct feedback from experienced founders, developers, investors, and ecosystem leaders throughout your build journey.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Builder Workshops:</strong> Meet and build alongside the community through offline workshops and working sessions across Hanoi, Da Nang, Ho Chi Minh &amp; Vung Tau City.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Demo Day:</strong> Pitch your product in front of the judging panel, get real feedback, and show what you’ve built.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Infrastructure Support:</strong> Access credits, discounts, and developer resources from infrastructure partners across wallets, RPCs, security, data, payments, and more.</span></p><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Prizes &amp; Builder Resources</strong></span></h2><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Road to Colosseum features a <strong>$10,000 cash prize pool</strong>, plus infrastructure credits, mentorship, security, and go-to-market support from ecosystem partners and innovation centers including National Startup Support Center (NSSC)&nbsp; and Da Nang Innovation Startup Support Center (DISSC).</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Partner benefits include:</span></p><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Solscan:</strong> 3 free Solscan Pro API Lite spots per team throughout the program, plus 30 extra days for teams advancing to the Colosseum Global Hackathon and direct technical support from Solscan engineers.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Solami: </strong>Pro Plan access for each participant with 200 requests/second, 2 gRPC streams, and 5TB extra bandwidth, plus $2,000 in additional prizes for top teams using Solami.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Souls Lab: </strong>Strategic positioning, market-entry, GTM, and community distribution support for selected teams.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Themis: </strong>Free security scans, discounted audits, and security consultation.</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Additional resources and support will come from MonkeDAO, Solflare, Paymoji, Hashgraph and more ecosystem partners to be announced.</span></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Register now our Workshop and Office hours: </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">https://luma.com/superteam-vietnam</span></a></p><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Rewards</strong></span></p><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">🥇 <strong>First Prize:</strong> $4,000 USDC</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">🥈 <strong>Second Prize:</strong> $2,000 USDC</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">🥉 <strong>Third Prize:</strong> $1,000 USDC</span></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>3 Side Track Prize:</strong> $1,000 USDC</span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"heading-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></h2><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">To be eligible for Road to Colosseum, your project must:</span></p><ul class=\"list-node\"><li><p class=\"text-node\">Submit your info <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://forms.gle/MaCQbiJqtTDyuDvu8\">here</a> and join the group: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://t.me/+omfclXsW2z04Mjhl\">https://t.me/+omfclXsW2z04Mjhl</a></p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Meet the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"><u>official eligibility requirements</u></a> of the Colosseum Global Hackathon.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">The Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">Register on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com\">Colosseum platform</a> and select “Vietnam” as your base country.</p></li><li><p class=\"text-node\">You must pitch your project IRL on our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/e5iu9t0h\">Demo Day</a> (4th October) in HCMC. <br></p></li></ul><p class=\"text-node\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">Full details:</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/SuperteamVN/status/2099532805227303290?s=20\"><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\">https://x.com/SuperteamVN/status/2099532805227303290?s=20</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"> </span><br><br><span style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"><strong>Build. Ship. Show your #PROOFofBUILD.</strong></span></p>",
